      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あたしは“闘技場の白髪鬼”にどうしても会いたい。\nそのためには、地下牢に潜入しなきゃいけないの。\nでも、当然見張りがいる筈だわ。\nできたら、その陽動をお願いできないかしら？",
        "official_en": "I must meet with the White-Maned Demon at\nany cost, which means I need to sneak into the\ndungeon where he's kept. But it's well guarded.\nWould you create a diversion for me?",
        "real_en": null
      },
