      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "白髪鬼……ベルトランを殺すのはまだ先よ……\nその日が来るまで精々震えてもらうわ！\n今回は迷惑をかけたわね。何かお礼をしないと。\n何かあったら呼んで。絶対力になるって約束する！",
        "official_en": "It's not yet time to kill the White-Maned Demon—\nBertrand. I want him to be trembling with fear for\nthat day. But I know you've gone to a lot of trouble\nfor me, so please, let me know if you need anything.",
